# BTH CODEOWNERS — the second, independent layer of the merge gate.
#
# The `gate` check (classify-pr.mjs + merge-tiers.json) is the primary mechanism.
# This file is the backstop: if the classifier ever has a bug, GitHub ITSELF still
# demands Ty's review on every money / tracking / claims / sending path below.
# Two independent systems must both fail for a Tier C change to slip through.
#
# Requires branch protection setting: require_code_owner_reviews = true
#
# Anything NOT listed here has no code owner — that is deliberate. Those are the
# Tier A/B paths that are allowed to auto-merge on green.
# Keep this file in sync with the "C" globs in .github/merge-tiers.json.

# --- The gate's own machinery. Never auto. An agent must never be able to widen its own authority.
/.github/                       @builttohoop
/CODEOWNERS                     @builttohoop
/.gitignore                     @builttohoop
/CNAME                          @builttohoop

# --- Money & conversion surfaces -----------------------------------------------------
/index.html                     @builttohoop
/join.html                      @builttohoop
/tier-1.html                    @builttohoop
/tier-2.html                    @builttohoop
/tier-3.html                    @builttohoop
/programs.html                  @builttohoop
/coaching.html                  @builttohoop
/addons.html                    @builttohoop
/reset.html                     @builttohoop
/thank-you.html                 @builttohoop
/bounce.html                    @builttohoop
/bth-operator-v2.html           @builttohoop

# --- Tracking & attribution. A drifted pixel ID silently poisons every ad decision.
/assets/bth-tracking.js         @builttohoop

# --- The service worker. It served stale HTML site-wide once already (2026-06-16).
#     A bad SW survives a revert in users' browsers — the one thing a rollback can't fix.
/bth-operator-sw.js             @builttohoop

# --- Anything that becomes a real, unrecallable send -----------------------------------
/email-sequences/               @builttohoop

# --- Delivered product content, public claims registry, legal, medical-adjacent content
/reset-pdfs/                    @builttohoop
/updates/                       @builttohoop
/privacy/                       @builttohoop
/seo/                           @builttohoop
